{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the throne and fix the corrupt kingdom... or worsen it! A life sim and visual novel where you are the villainess. Balance your stats, campaign for the crown, and romance 4 love interests. All your choices will affect the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A\u00a0<strong><u>1-2 hour demo</u></strong>, with 20k words across all choices/paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/extras/725b0b9977fdff6a0ed501bb88b26457.avif?t=1751636765\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/extras/08d7506c48660389d675ba4cd1f7ec11.avif?t=1751636765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 love interests whom you can choose to romance! Your relationships may affect the kingdom's story and your strategic alliances, so be careful who you befriend or offend.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edgar, the cold Duke of the North, who broke off his engagement to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helius, an influential but soft businessman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rosalie, a common girl turned future Duchess, beloved as the people's heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aeriselle, a mysterious girl from Atissia, for a villainess x villainess route</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/extras/9a48559d874f625093ce35b2e20864c3.avif?t=1751636765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Lucena Sariez, a lady who has been branded a 'villainess'. After the Duke broke off his engagement with you, you decided to enter the election and fight to become Queen. Will you live up to your reputation, or try to win the hearts of your kingdom's people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/extras/47212cd6fbc6cd10dba86769555d316e.avif?t=1751636765\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/extras/143390030bc307867394cad3ebec2a8e.avif?t=1751636765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose daily activities and make choices, which will affect the kingdom's story and your personal stats. You can succeed or fail, have enemies or allies, be good or evil-- it's your choice to make.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845740?t=1751636765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845740?t=1751636765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/3af644160d6951c5fb85b3cc9cda94190629fa6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751636765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845740/3af644160d6951c5fb85b3cc9cda94190629fa6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751636765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the throne and fix the corrupt kingdom... or worsen it! A life sim and visual novel where you are the villainess. Balance your stats, campaign for the crown, and romance 4 love interests. All your choices will affect the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A\u00a0<strong><u>1-2 hour demo</u></strong>, with 20k words across all choices/paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cl